{"transcription": [{"offsets": {"from": 1000, "to": 5000}, "text": " I'm here with Ted Whale, and you're 105?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 5000, "to": 14000}, "text": " I'm 105, and on August the 12th this year I'll be 106."}, {"offsets": {"from": 14000, "to": 15000}, "text": " 106."}, {"offsets": {"from": 15000, "to": 16000}, "text": " Yes."}, {"offsets": {"from": 20000, "to": 25000}, "text": " And, Ted's got a transmitter, and you've built this little transmitter, Ted."}, {"offsets": {"from": 25000, "to": 27000}, "text": " That's the transmitter."}, {"offsets": {"from": 27000, "to": 30000}, "text": " Yep. How long ago did you build that?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 30000, "to": 33000}, "text": " Well, a few years ago I made that."}, {"offsets": {"from": 33000, "to": 38000}, "text": " So you built that a few years ago, so you built that when you were 100?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 38000, "to": 40000}, "text": " Er..."}, {"offsets": {"from": 40000, "to": 43000}, "text": " Maybe? Because you're 105 now."}, {"offsets": {"from": 43000, "to": 47000}, "text": " No, no, this one would be made a few more years ago."}, {"offsets": {"from": 47000, "to": 49000}, "text": " A few more years ago than that."}, {"offsets": {"from": 49000, "to": 55000}, "text": " It was more or less for educational purposes, and I'm working on two transistors."}, {"offsets": {"from": 56000, "to": 60000}, "text": " And what frequency is that transmitting on?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 60000, "to": 63000}, "text": " What I showed you in there, 90."}, {"offsets": {"from": 63000, "to": 65000}, "text": " It was around about 90 megs?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 65000, "to": 69000}, "text": " You see that there?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 69000, "to": 73000}, "text": " There's a coil about three turns in that, and a tapping on it."}, {"offsets": {"from": 73000, "to": 81000}, "text": " It's just like an auto radio transformer with the tapping on."}, {"offsets": {"from": 81000, "to": 87000}, "text": " And it's got the tank, the condenser next to it."}, {"offsets": {"from": 87000, "to": 89000}, "text": " The box, where did you get that from?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 89000, "to": 90000}, "text": " Just a little..."}, {"offsets": {"from": 90000, "to": 91000}, "text": " J-Car."}, {"offsets": {"from": 91000, "to": 92000}, "text": " J-Car box, yep."}, {"offsets": {"from": 92000, "to": 96000}, "text": " It's glued on, I can't show you."}, {"offsets": {"from": 96000, "to": 97000}, "text": " That's alright."}, {"offsets": {"from": 97000, "to": 102000}, "text": " But I engraved it with an engraver's tool."}, {"offsets": {"from": 102000, "to": 104000}, "text": " Oh, you used an engraver."}, {"offsets": {"from": 104000, "to": 105000}, "text": " Right."}, {"offsets": {"from": 105000, "to": 108000}, "text": " I don't use it, it has to do with ferrite."}, {"offsets": {"from": 108000, "to": 110000}, "text": " Oh, so you don't use ferrite chloride."}, {"offsets": {"from": 110000, "to": 111000}, "text": " No, you just..."}, {"offsets": {"from": 111000, "to": 112000}, "text": " Too much messing about."}, {"offsets": {"from": 112000, "to": 113000}, "text": " Too much messing about."}, {"offsets": {"from": 113000, "to": 114000}, "text": " I agree."}, {"offsets": {"from": 114000, "to": 118000}, "text": " I mark it off, and I just cut it out, and I've got a little tiny..."}, {"offsets": {"from": 118000, "to": 126000}, "text": " I've got a little drill there, and I can drill one, about a millimetre drill if I wanted to."}, {"offsets": {"from": 126000, "to": 129000}, "text": " Just enough to let the wires go through."}, {"offsets": {"from": 129000, "to": 131000}, "text": " You know these kids' Lego toys?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 131000, "to": 132000}, "text": " Oh yeah?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 132000, "to": 134000}, "text": " It's a Lego."}, {"offsets": {"from": 134000, "to": 135000}, "text": " It's a piece of Lego."}, {"offsets": {"from": 135000, "to": 143000}, "text": " I've got these nice little corner bits, and I've got a 6x8 screw in there,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 143000, "to": 146000}, "text": " and that's glued on with this hot glue."}, {"offsets": {"from": 146000, "to": 147000}, "text": " Good work, Ted."}, {"offsets": {"from": 147000, "to": 155000}, "text": " And two AA batteries, they give me three volts."}, {"offsets": {"from": 155000, "to": 157000}, "text": " How much current does it draw?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 157000, "to": 164000}, "text": " With a linear amplifier on it, it would probably use up to 10 milliamps."}, {"offsets": {"from": 164000, "to": 165000}, "text": " 10, yep."}, {"offsets": {"from": 165000, "to": 168000}, "text": " But I think as it is now, it uses about 5."}, {"offsets": {"from": 168000, "to": 170000}, "text": " About 5 milliamps, yep."}, {"offsets": {"from": 170000, "to": 171000}, "text": " That's all right."}, {"offsets": {"from": 171000, "to": 172000}, "text": " Not very much."}, {"offsets": {"from": 172000, "to": 174000}, "text": " You should get good battery life from that."}, {"offsets": {"from": 174000, "to": 175000}, "text": " I'll show you the other one."}, {"offsets": {"from": 175000, "to": 177000}, "text": " All right, let's go."}, {"offsets": {"from": 177000, "to": 181000}, "text": " And here's the FM wireless microphone that Ted built,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 181000, "to": 187000}, "text": " and he says he never loans out his magazines because they never come back."}, {"offsets": {"from": 188000, "to": 200000}, "text": " And the hydrogens in the catalyst develop to about 1.5 volts or so."}, {"offsets": {"from": 200000, "to": 201000}, "text": " But anyway."}, {"offsets": {"from": 201000, "to": 204000}, "text": " All right, we've got another transmitter."}, {"offsets": {"from": 204000, "to": 206000}, "text": " There we go."}, {"offsets": {"from": 206000, "to": 209000}, "text": " He's got FM bugs all over the place."}, {"offsets": {"from": 209000, "to": 215000}, "text": " And that looks like one of the original talking electronic ones, is it?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 215000, "to": 217000}, "text": " There's pamphlets there."}, {"offsets": {"from": 217000, "to": 218000}, "text": " Oh, there we go."}, {"offsets": {"from": 218000, "to": 219000}, "text": " Comes from Melbourne."}, {"offsets": {"from": 219000, "to": 220000}, "text": " It does."}, {"offsets": {"from": 220000, "to": 225000}, "text": " I've actually met Colin Mitchell from Talking Electronics."}, {"offsets": {"from": 225000, "to": 230000}, "text": " This one, I made this one over 10 years ago."}, {"offsets": {"from": 230000, "to": 231000}, "text": " Over 10?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 231000, "to": 235000}, "text": " But you were still, what, 95 when you made that?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 235000, "to": 237000}, "text": " See the tank coil there?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 237000, "to": 238000}, "text": " Yep."}, {"offsets": {"from": 238000, "to": 241000}, "text": " There's about five turns on."}, {"offsets": {"from": 241000, "to": 246000}, "text": " If I put five turns on, I get down to the 90s, 88 or 90."}, {"offsets": {"from": 246000, "to": 248000}, "text": " Yep, 88, 90 meg."}, {"offsets": {"from": 248000, "to": 255000}, "text": " If I put four or even three, I go up to about 108 megs."}, {"offsets": {"from": 255000, "to": 257000}, "text": " That one works on two transistors."}, {"offsets": {"from": 257000, "to": 259000}, "text": " You can see the one there."}, {"offsets": {"from": 259000, "to": 260000}, "text": " Yep."}, {"offsets": {"from": 260000, "to": 262000}, "text": " One there."}, {"offsets": {"from": 263000, "to": 271000}, "text": " This one here, in conjunction with that coil,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 271000, "to": 277000}, "text": " and there's a little tiny condenser in there."}, {"offsets": {"from": 277000, "to": 279000}, "text": " You call them condensers still."}, {"offsets": {"from": 279000, "to": 280000}, "text": " Condenser?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 280000, "to": 281000}, "text": " Yeah, you still call them a condenser."}, {"offsets": {"from": 281000, "to": 282000}, "text": " Capacitor, if you like."}, {"offsets": {"from": 282000, "to": 284000}, "text": " Capacitor, if you like."}, {"offsets": {"from": 284000, "to": 286000}, "text": " You're a bit old school, aren't you, Ted?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 286000, "to": 292000}, "text": " To change the frequency, you close the coil in or spread it,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 292000, "to": 294000}, "text": " and it's a bit tedious, you know?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 294000, "to": 295000}, "text": " Yep."}, {"offsets": {"from": 295000, "to": 300000}, "text": " This one here has got a synthetic iron screw."}, {"offsets": {"from": 300000, "to": 301000}, "text": " Ah, cool."}, {"offsets": {"from": 301000, "to": 302000}, "text": " Ah, screw, yep."}, {"offsets": {"from": 302000, "to": 305000}, "text": " Then I get the plastic screwdriver,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 305000, "to": 309000}, "text": " and I just turn that little tiny bit and get me rid of it."}, {"offsets": {"from": 309000, "to": 313000}, "text": " That's why I like this one, because it's easy to adjust."}, {"offsets": {"from": 313000, "to": 316000}, "text": " But in the process of moving around,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 316000, "to": 324000}, "text": " and they say use a thick wire because it won't change your frequency."}, {"offsets": {"from": 324000, "to": 329000}, "text": " But when you come through, you've only got a printed circuit underneath,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 329000, "to": 332000}, "text": " and when you go moving around,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 332000, "to": 335000}, "text": " you're likely to damage the circuit underneath."}, {"offsets": {"from": 335000, "to": 337000}, "text": " Exactly."}, {"offsets": {"from": 337000, "to": 340000}, "text": " Another thing, too, it takes more heat to solder,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 340000, "to": 343000}, "text": " and that unsolders off the track."}, {"offsets": {"from": 343000, "to": 344000}, "text": " That's it."}, {"offsets": {"from": 344000, "to": 346000}, "text": " It'll pull straight off, yeah."}, {"offsets": {"from": 346000, "to": 350000}, "text": " It's very important where you put the area."}, {"offsets": {"from": 350000, "to": 353000}, "text": " And sometimes I put my hand there like that,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 353000, "to": 356000}, "text": " and I get body capacity coming and messing it up."}, {"offsets": {"from": 356000, "to": 360000}, "text": " Exactly, yep."}, {"offsets": {"from": 360000, "to": 365000}, "text": " FM is all right, but it's not what it's cracked up to be."}, {"offsets": {"from": 365000, "to": 370000}, "text": " All right, here's Ted's workshop, or junk room."}, {"offsets": {"from": 370000, "to": 373000}, "text": " How long have you lived here?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 373000, "to": 378000}, "text": " Oh, a bit over 50 years now."}, {"offsets": {"from": 378000, "to": 387000}, "text": " 50 years."}, {"offsets": {"from": 387000, "to": 391000}, "text": " Now, if I watch the bench slide,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 391000, "to": 397000}, "text": " I'll get this one for close-up."}, {"offsets": {"from": 397000, "to": 400000}, "text": " There's some of the things I've been taking off the bench."}, {"offsets": {"from": 400000, "to": 401000}, "text": " There we go."}, {"offsets": {"from": 401000, "to": 403000}, "text": " You've got another FM bug."}, {"offsets": {"from": 403000, "to": 410000}, "text": " It's similar to the other one I showed you."}, {"offsets": {"from": 410000, "to": 413000}, "text": " I think there's a dry joint in that."}, {"offsets": {"from": 413000, "to": 418000}, "text": " And I engraved the circuit."}, {"offsets": {"from": 418000, "to": 423000}, "text": " So you engrave your PCBs, not etch them?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 423000, "to": 430000}, "text": " No, I made up a little one with a 555 IC."}, {"offsets": {"from": 430000, "to": 431000}, "text": " You know what I mean?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 431000, "to": 432000}, "text": " I know what you mean."}, {"offsets": {"from": 432000, "to": 437000}, "text": " It's really switching or oscillating,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 437000, "to": 440000}, "text": " whatever you like, you can use it for."}, {"offsets": {"from": 440000, "to": 443000}, "text": " And the 740 one is the amplifier one."}, {"offsets": {"from": 443000, "to": 447000}, "text": " I'll show you the engraver first, one thing at a time."}, {"offsets": {"from": 447000, "to": 453000}, "text": " There's one engraver, and there's the other one."}, {"offsets": {"from": 453000, "to": 456000}, "text": " Right, so you use those to engrave your PCBs."}, {"offsets": {"from": 456000, "to": 462000}, "text": " You just go like that and scrape them off."}, {"offsets": {"from": 462000, "to": 472000}, "text": " You need a steady hand, and you need a little bit of practice."}, {"offsets": {"from": 472000, "to": 476000}, "text": " And you've got an old ohmmeter there."}, {"offsets": {"from": 476000, "to": 482000}, "text": " That was a post office linesman's meter or something."}, {"offsets": {"from": 482000, "to": 485000}, "text": " They gave it to me."}, {"offsets": {"from": 485000, "to": 492000}, "text": " And they changed it, and I recalibrated them."}, {"offsets": {"from": 492000, "to": 499000}, "text": " And I get 8 volts full scale, or twice, 16,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 499000, "to": 504000}, "text": " or depending if I'm checking the car battery, I get a 16."}, {"offsets": {"from": 504000, "to": 506000}, "text": " That's a 16."}, {"offsets": {"from": 506000, "to": 512000}, "text": " And if I want continuity, I put it down here,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 512000, "to": 515000}, "text": " and that brings in the ohm scale."}, {"offsets": {"from": 515000, "to": 517000}, "text": " Are you familiar with bridges?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 517000, "to": 519000}, "text": " I know all about bridges, yes."}, {"offsets": {"from": 519000, "to": 521000}, "text": " You know Wheatstone Bridge?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 521000, "to": 523000}, "text": " I do know Wheatstone Bridge, yes."}, {"offsets": {"from": 523000, "to": 524000}, "text": " Well, do you know the Wean Bridge?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 524000, "to": 526000}, "text": " Yes, I know the Wean Bridge, yes."}, {"offsets": {"from": 526000, "to": 527000}, "text": " Well, I made one of those."}, {"offsets": {"from": 527000, "to": 528000}, "text": " Right."}, {"offsets": {"from": 528000, "to": 530000}, "text": " I made one for the council,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 530000, "to": 534000}, "text": " and we fit it into a beautiful box that the carpenters had made,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 534000, "to": 537000}, "text": " polished and everything."}, {"offsets": {"from": 537000, "to": 542000}, "text": " And they were using it to measuring underground gas-filled"}, {"offsets": {"from": 542000, "to": 545000}, "text": " or oil-filled cables."}, {"offsets": {"from": 545000, "to": 548000}, "text": " And they could use, with the Wean Bridge,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 548000, "to": 557000}, "text": " they could almost check to the exact spot where any leakage occurred."}, {"offsets": {"from": 557000, "to": 562000}, "text": " And it used to save me a hell of a lot of digging up half a street looking for it."}, {"offsets": {"from": 562000, "to": 563000}, "text": " Right, nice."}, {"offsets": {"from": 563000, "to": 566000}, "text": " And with the Wean Bridge and a bit of calculation,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 566000, "to": 569000}, "text": " they knew just where to put their fingers on it."}, {"offsets": {"from": 569000, "to": 571000}, "text": " The battery charger."}, {"offsets": {"from": 571000, "to": 575000}, "text": " I can go up to 6 amps for short oil."}, {"offsets": {"from": 575000, "to": 580000}, "text": " That's a power supply."}, {"offsets": {"from": 580000, "to": 586000}, "text": " It gives me up to 20 volts."}, {"offsets": {"from": 586000, "to": 589000}, "text": " That's 2 amps."}, {"offsets": {"from": 589000, "to": 592000}, "text": " In the side there's a little red button."}, {"offsets": {"from": 592000, "to": 595000}, "text": " And if I exceed a certain,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 595000, "to": 599000}, "text": " I just got sick of putting chairs in."}, {"offsets": {"from": 599000, "to": 604000}, "text": " All I've got to do is push the button back in again when I find the trouble."}, {"offsets": {"from": 604000, "to": 610000}, "text": " I've got xenoglides in there."}, {"offsets": {"from": 610000, "to": 612000}, "text": " I'm on 3 volts now."}, {"offsets": {"from": 612000, "to": 613000}, "text": " Yep."}, {"offsets": {"from": 613000, "to": 614000}, "text": " That's my bugs."}, {"offsets": {"from": 614000, "to": 615000}, "text": " Oh, for your FM bugs?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 615000, "to": 616000}, "text": " Now I've got 5."}, {"offsets": {"from": 616000, "to": 618000}, "text": " I've brought in the 5 xeno."}, {"offsets": {"from": 618000, "to": 625000}, "text": " Provided I've got, say, 10 or 11 volts, I can still get 9."}, {"offsets": {"from": 625000, "to": 629000}, "text": " I put it all on wood because I didn't have anything else."}, {"offsets": {"from": 629000, "to": 631000}, "text": " But I do use this quite a bit."}, {"offsets": {"from": 631000, "to": 632000}, "text": " Oh, yeah."}, {"offsets": {"from": 632000, "to": 635000}, "text": " Now there's the one with the linear."}, {"offsets": {"from": 635000, "to": 640000}, "text": " That's the linear amplifier tank coil there, see?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 640000, "to": 641000}, "text": " Oh, yeah."}, {"offsets": {"from": 641000, "to": 644000}, "text": " Now this was bought from Dick Smith."}, {"offsets": {"from": 644000, "to": 648000}, "text": " And then I made one after."}, {"offsets": {"from": 648000, "to": 652000}, "text": " But down here, it's so complicated."}, {"offsets": {"from": 652000, "to": 660000}, "text": " And yet, take away, cut this part off like you saw inside."}, {"offsets": {"from": 660000, "to": 665000}, "text": " I didn't need that, and I didn't need the extra transistor."}, {"offsets": {"from": 665000, "to": 669000}, "text": " It's got a switch in it too, and there's the adjusting slug."}, {"offsets": {"from": 669000, "to": 670000}, "text": " Yep."}, {"offsets": {"from": 670000, "to": 674000}, "text": " There's the antenna."}, {"offsets": {"from": 674000, "to": 681000}, "text": " Now, almost identical is the circuit, but different values."}, {"offsets": {"from": 681000, "to": 682000}, "text": " Yep."}, {"offsets": {"from": 682000, "to": 684000}, "text": " Is that."}, {"offsets": {"from": 684000, "to": 687000}, "text": " And this, look at that."}, {"offsets": {"from": 687000, "to": 691000}, "text": " Okay, so you bought this from Dick Smith, and then you remade this one."}, {"offsets": {"from": 691000, "to": 694000}, "text": " Yeah, forget this part here, see?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 694000, "to": 695000}, "text": " Yep."}, {"offsets": {"from": 695000, "to": 696000}, "text": " Now look at that."}, {"offsets": {"from": 696000, "to": 697000}, "text": " Which is the best one to make?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 697000, "to": 699000}, "text": " Oh, that's the better one."}, {"offsets": {"from": 699000, "to": 700000}, "text": " It's much easier."}, {"offsets": {"from": 700000, "to": 701000}, "text": " It's straightforward."}, {"offsets": {"from": 701000, "to": 702000}, "text": " It is."}, {"offsets": {"from": 702000, "to": 706000}, "text": " It takes up so much room."}, {"offsets": {"from": 706000, "to": 709000}, "text": " I did experiment and put one of these little."}, {"offsets": {"from": 709000, "to": 712000}, "text": " I got half a dozen of those I bought cheap."}, {"offsets": {"from": 712000, "to": 716000}, "text": " See, that's only got three turns."}, {"offsets": {"from": 716000, "to": 722000}, "text": " I was going to put one there, but it's a little bit high and a little bit."}, {"offsets": {"from": 722000, "to": 726000}, "text": " I was trying to keep it as small as I could."}, {"offsets": {"from": 726000, "to": 730000}, "text": " I think it's a bit of a mistake to try and make things too small."}, {"offsets": {"from": 730000, "to": 733000}, "text": " I buy the solder by the roll."}, {"offsets": {"from": 733000, "to": 735000}, "text": " I just pull it off here."}, {"offsets": {"from": 735000, "to": 740000}, "text": " I've got a little round channel I put here."}, {"offsets": {"from": 740000, "to": 742000}, "text": " And here's your soldering iron."}, {"offsets": {"from": 742000, "to": 744000}, "text": " You made your own holder for it."}, {"offsets": {"from": 744000, "to": 746000}, "text": " That's a 240, yeah."}, {"offsets": {"from": 746000, "to": 749000}, "text": " Yeah."}, {"offsets": {"from": 749000, "to": 752000}, "text": " Do you ever use the water for cleaning the iron?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 752000, "to": 754000}, "text": " Yes, yeah, with sponge."}, {"offsets": {"from": 754000, "to": 755000}, "text": " With plastic."}, {"offsets": {"from": 755000, "to": 757000}, "text": " Yeah, I have this one here somewhere."}, {"offsets": {"from": 757000, "to": 759000}, "text": " I haven't been using it."}, {"offsets": {"from": 759000, "to": 762000}, "text": " I generally use."}, {"offsets": {"from": 762000, "to": 764000}, "text": " There's enough."}, {"offsets": {"from": 764000, "to": 767000}, "text": " If you can get your work cleaned up properly."}, {"offsets": {"from": 767000, "to": 769000}, "text": " It's got an internal flux in the water."}, {"offsets": {"from": 769000, "to": 770000}, "text": " Yes, yes, it does."}, {"offsets": {"from": 770000, "to": 771000}, "text": " Flux inside the core."}, {"offsets": {"from": 771000, "to": 774000}, "text": " I like the small stuff because I only use."}, {"offsets": {"from": 774000, "to": 780000}, "text": " And if you get a bigger stuff, you get a big blob off for nothing."}, {"offsets": {"from": 780000, "to": 781000}, "text": " You don't want it."}, {"offsets": {"from": 781000, "to": 783000}, "text": " Is this your multimeter, Ted?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 783000, "to": 785000}, "text": " It's a metal one I made up."}, {"offsets": {"from": 785000, "to": 787000}, "text": " Oh, you made it."}, {"offsets": {"from": 787000, "to": 789000}, "text": " That's great."}, {"offsets": {"from": 789000, "to": 791000}, "text": " I like this idea a bit."}, {"offsets": {"from": 791000, "to": 795000}, "text": " As you plug in, it sort of cleans it."}, {"offsets": {"from": 795000, "to": 799000}, "text": " But I don't like these rotary switches."}, {"offsets": {"from": 799000, "to": 800000}, "text": " I don't like those."}, {"offsets": {"from": 800000, "to": 801000}, "text": " I like."}, {"offsets": {"from": 801000, "to": 803000}, "text": " There's nothing to go wrong with it."}, {"offsets": {"from": 803000, "to": 804000}, "text": " Exactly, a jack."}, {"offsets": {"from": 804000, "to": 805000}, "text": " You just plug it in."}, {"offsets": {"from": 805000, "to": 806000}, "text": " Yeah."}, {"offsets": {"from": 806000, "to": 808000}, "text": " It's a university made in Sydney."}, {"offsets": {"from": 808000, "to": 810000}, "text": " Strange as it might seem."}, {"offsets": {"from": 810000, "to": 812000}, "text": " So how long ago did you make this?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 812000, "to": 814000}, "text": " Oh, gee."}, {"offsets": {"from": 814000, "to": 816000}, "text": " Could be 20, 30 years ago."}, {"offsets": {"from": 816000, "to": 817000}, "text": " 20, 30 years ago?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 817000, "to": 820000}, "text": " I wanted it like that with the big figures."}, {"offsets": {"from": 820000, "to": 823000}, "text": " I've got another one, a Tandy in there."}, {"offsets": {"from": 823000, "to": 827000}, "text": " There's about six different scars and they drive me mad."}, {"offsets": {"from": 827000, "to": 830000}, "text": " And you've got to sort out the scars, you know."}, {"offsets": {"from": 830000, "to": 835000}, "text": " I think you should have a meter for each function."}, {"offsets": {"from": 835000, "to": 837000}, "text": " Absolutely."}, {"offsets": {"from": 837000, "to": 839000}, "text": " None of this multimeter rubbish."}, {"offsets": {"from": 839000, "to": 841000}, "text": " You've got an ammeter and a voltmeter."}, {"offsets": {"from": 841000, "to": 843000}, "text": " That's the amp scale."}, {"offsets": {"from": 843000, "to": 844000}, "text": " Yep."}, {"offsets": {"from": 844000, "to": 847000}, "text": " You go up to two amps on that."}, {"offsets": {"from": 847000, "to": 849000}, "text": " Where do you think that's made?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 849000, "to": 852000}, "text": " Is that made in Australia too?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 852000, "to": 854000}, "text": " USSR."}, {"offsets": {"from": 854000, "to": 855000}, "text": " Russian."}, {"offsets": {"from": 855000, "to": 856000}, "text": " That's Russian."}, {"offsets": {"from": 856000, "to": 857000}, "text": " Wow."}, {"offsets": {"from": 857000, "to": 861000}, "text": " They're supposed to be educational meters, but they're really good."}, {"offsets": {"from": 861000, "to": 866000}, "text": " Do you know there's no such thing as a moving coil voltmeter?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 866000, "to": 867000}, "text": " Why?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 868000, "to": 870000}, "text": " Because it's an amp meter."}, {"offsets": {"from": 870000, "to": 871000}, "text": " Very true."}, {"offsets": {"from": 871000, "to": 874000}, "text": " It requires microamps to operate it."}, {"offsets": {"from": 874000, "to": 875000}, "text": " Very true."}, {"offsets": {"from": 875000, "to": 876000}, "text": " Good one, Ted."}, {"offsets": {"from": 876000, "to": 877000}, "text": " It does."}, {"offsets": {"from": 877000, "to": 880000}, "text": " I had an argument with a bloke at work one time."}, {"offsets": {"from": 880000, "to": 882000}, "text": " I've got another one inside."}, {"offsets": {"from": 882000, "to": 889000}, "text": " It works on the electrostatics."}, {"offsets": {"from": 889000, "to": 890000}, "text": " Oh, yeah."}, {"offsets": {"from": 890000, "to": 893000}, "text": " It's, you know, the moving blades."}, {"offsets": {"from": 893000, "to": 894000}, "text": " Yes."}, {"offsets": {"from": 894000, "to": 897000}, "text": " And I think I can get up to 5,000."}, {"offsets": {"from": 897000, "to": 901000}, "text": " A lot of these I made just sometimes."}, {"offsets": {"from": 901000, "to": 903000}, "text": " We'd get a bit of spare time at work."}, {"offsets": {"from": 903000, "to": 906000}, "text": " I didn't use to make them in the workstorm."}, {"offsets": {"from": 906000, "to": 913000}, "text": " I made them and do a little bit and do a little bit and something to do after I had my lunch"}, {"offsets": {"from": 913000, "to": 915000}, "text": " because this is my doorstop."}, {"offsets": {"from": 915000, "to": 917000}, "text": " Doorstop."}, {"offsets": {"from": 917000, "to": 920000}, "text": " This is what I do for my wire."}, {"offsets": {"from": 920000, "to": 924000}, "text": " All the old things have been thrown out on the street."}, {"offsets": {"from": 924000, "to": 927000}, "text": " If I see a bit of wire, I nip it off."}, {"offsets": {"from": 927000, "to": 930000}, "text": " It's a little easel I made for kids."}, {"offsets": {"from": 930000, "to": 932000}, "text": " Nice."}, {"offsets": {"from": 932000, "to": 933000}, "text": " You're an artist."}, {"offsets": {"from": 933000, "to": 935000}, "text": " Oh, yes, sort of."}, {"offsets": {"from": 935000, "to": 937000}, "text": " You see all that."}, {"offsets": {"from": 937000, "to": 939000}, "text": " Oh, that's only a few."}, {"offsets": {"from": 939000, "to": 943000}, "text": " Some of them are only sort of caricatures."}, {"offsets": {"from": 951000, "to": 954000}, "text": " You'd be familiar with megas, wouldn't you?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 954000, "to": 956000}, "text": " I am, yes."}, {"offsets": {"from": 956000, "to": 957000}, "text": " We've got a mega."}, {"offsets": {"from": 957000, "to": 959000}, "text": " That's the one I made."}, {"offsets": {"from": 959000, "to": 961000}, "text": " You made your own mega."}, {"offsets": {"from": 961000, "to": 962000}, "text": " Nice."}, {"offsets": {"from": 962000, "to": 970000}, "text": " It works off of a big, a big, a big, a 500 volt."}, {"offsets": {"from": 971000, "to": 977000}, "text": " I'm getting 500 volts out of that from a one and a half battery."}, {"offsets": {"from": 977000, "to": 978000}, "text": " Nice."}, {"offsets": {"from": 978000, "to": 982000}, "text": " That was the sort of work I was doing at the council."}, {"offsets": {"from": 982000, "to": 985000}, "text": " Not working on the mains or anything."}, {"offsets": {"from": 985000, "to": 988000}, "text": " I was working on test instruments."}, {"offsets": {"from": 988000, "to": 991000}, "text": " I was working on test instruments."}, {"offsets": {"from": 991000, "to": 994000}, "text": " I was working on test instruments."}, {"offsets": {"from": 994000, "to": 996000}, "text": " Not working on the mains or anything."}, {"offsets": {"from": 996000, "to": 1000000}, "text": " I was working on test instruments."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1000000, "to": 1002000}, "text": " Now, see if I can find the bridge."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1002000, "to": 1009000}, "text": " I've got a Wheatstone bridge and I've got a Marconi bridge."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1009000, "to": 1011000}, "text": " This is the Wheatstone."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1011000, "to": 1013000}, "text": " There we go."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1013000, "to": 1014000}, "text": " Old Wheatstone bridge."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1014000, "to": 1015000}, "text": " Beautiful."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1015000, "to": 1021000}, "text": " I couldn't get a good centre zero null indicator,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 1021000, "to": 1023000}, "text": " so I took that out of a radio."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1023000, "to": 1027000}, "text": " I think it's a power or something."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1027000, "to": 1031000}, "text": " I made this switch up here."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1031000, "to": 1033000}, "text": " Showing me different values."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1033000, "to": 1034000}, "text": " Nice."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1034000, "to": 1035000}, "text": " And it's tapered."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1035000, "to": 1040000}, "text": " And as you screw it in, you turn it around and it cleans itself."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1040000, "to": 1042000}, "text": " Oh, nice."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1042000, "to": 1044000}, "text": " I made the box."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1044000, "to": 1047000}, "text": " I've got some old radios up there by the looks of it."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1047000, "to": 1048000}, "text": " They still work."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1048000, "to": 1051000}, "text": " They're good because they really need new valves."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1052000, "to": 1053000}, "text": " And what have we got here?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 1053000, "to": 1056000}, "text": " This is the Marconi."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1056000, "to": 1059000}, "text": " I think I can check condensers on this."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1059000, "to": 1060000}, "text": " This is what I made."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1060000, "to": 1064000}, "text": " I engraved this and I marked this off."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1064000, "to": 1068000}, "text": " When you null this one, you don't null it in the centre."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1068000, "to": 1070000}, "text": " It nulls here."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1070000, "to": 1074000}, "text": " If you go too far, it'll come back up again."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1074000, "to": 1077000}, "text": " It changes polarity somehow."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1077000, "to": 1079000}, "text": " I forget now."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1079000, "to": 1080000}, "text": " I used these."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1080000, "to": 1082000}, "text": " I made these at work."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1082000, "to": 1086000}, "text": " So for 30 years old,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 1086000, "to": 1092000}, "text": " when I had nothing to do for about half an hour,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 1092000, "to": 1095000}, "text": " I'd punch these out,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 1095000, "to": 1097000}, "text": " press these out."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1097000, "to": 1099000}, "text": " I've used it a few times."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1099000, "to": 1104000}, "text": " I think I made that one because I could measure a condenser,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 1104000, "to": 1106000}, "text": " a capacitor."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1106000, "to": 1110000}, "text": " This is another one for calibrating the meters."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1110000, "to": 1113000}, "text": " It's got a zener in there if you can see it."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1113000, "to": 1115000}, "text": " I don't know whether you can find it."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1115000, "to": 1116000}, "text": " Yep, I can see it."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1116000, "to": 1117000}, "text": " Can you see it?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 1117000, "to": 1118000}, "text": " Yeah, right there."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1118000, "to": 1119000}, "text": " Ah, yeah."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1119000, "to": 1120000}, "text": " There it is."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1120000, "to": 1121000}, "text": " They're very small."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1121000, "to": 1123000}, "text": " The zeners are very accurate."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1123000, "to": 1126000}, "text": " You could use them for a standard almost."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1126000, "to": 1128000}, "text": " Have you ever seen a clock cell?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 1128000, "to": 1129000}, "text": " Yes, I have."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1129000, "to": 1131000}, "text": " Like the H shape?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 1131000, "to": 1132000}, "text": " Yes."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1132000, "to": 1133000}, "text": " I used to have one of those."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1133000, "to": 1135000}, "text": " I think they had mercury in them, didn't they?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 1135000, "to": 1136000}, "text": " I think so."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1136000, "to": 1137000}, "text": " I think they may have."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1137000, "to": 1138000}, "text": " Nasty."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1138000, "to": 1139000}, "text": " They're a thing of the past now."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1139000, "to": 1140000}, "text": " Yep."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1140000, "to": 1143000}, "text": " And that was a bugger."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1143000, "to": 1145000}, "text": " I had the bugger in there,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 1145000, "to": 1147000}, "text": " that little one you showed in there."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1147000, "to": 1148000}, "text": " Oh, yeah, right."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1148000, "to": 1149000}, "text": " It was in there,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 1149000, "to": 1152000}, "text": " and I only had one half volt default,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 1152000, "to": 1156000}, "text": " and a double A there,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 1156000, "to": 1158000}, "text": " and on there."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1158000, "to": 1160000}, "text": " Ah, a magnet."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1160000, "to": 1161000}, "text": " Sticks on."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1161000, "to": 1164000}, "text": " It's glued on the fence or anywhere."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1164000, "to": 1166000}, "text": " You keep your components in jars."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1166000, "to": 1167000}, "text": " I love it."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1167000, "to": 1169000}, "text": " Ah, screws and things, yeah."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1169000, "to": 1170000}, "text": " No, no."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1170000, "to": 1172000}, "text": " You've got through-hole condensers."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1172000, "to": 1173000}, "text": " They'd come down here."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1173000, "to": 1175000}, "text": " You'd go to school,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 1175000, "to": 1178000}, "text": " and they'd sit here and unscrew all the screws"}, {"offsets": {"from": 1178000, "to": 1181000}, "text": " and all the scrap things I'd pick up in the street."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1181000, "to": 1182000}, "text": " They were so..."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1182000, "to": 1184000}, "text": " And they're nice and light."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1184000, "to": 1187000}, "text": " It comes in handy when you lose one sometimes"}, {"offsets": {"from": 1187000, "to": 1188000}, "text": " and you can't find it."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1188000, "to": 1192000}, "text": " And a bunch of switches and pots."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1192000, "to": 1193000}, "text": " Terrific."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1193000, "to": 1194000}, "text": " Old school."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1194000, "to": 1196000}, "text": " I love it."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1196000, "to": 1197000}, "text": " Trimmer caps."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1197000, "to": 1201000}, "text": " I've got them all labelled."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1201000, "to": 1202000}, "text": " Ah, diode bridges."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1202000, "to": 1204000}, "text": " I think they're rectifiers."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1204000, "to": 1205000}, "text": " Yep."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1205000, "to": 1207000}, "text": " Oh, you've got RF rectifiers."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1207000, "to": 1209000}, "text": " Yeah, I made a Christmas set."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1209000, "to": 1210000}, "text": " Oh, okay."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1210000, "to": 1213000}, "text": " I even got it up a Galena."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1213000, "to": 1216000}, "text": " A bit bigger than my thumbnail,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 1216000, "to": 1218000}, "text": " about twice as big."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1218000, "to": 1220000}, "text": " We've got a bit of that inside,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 1220000, "to": 1222000}, "text": " and you can use Galena,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 1222000, "to": 1224000}, "text": " and you can use Carborundum."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1224000, "to": 1228000}, "text": " They're sort of low-power transistors."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1228000, "to": 1229000}, "text": " Yep."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1229000, "to": 1231000}, "text": " BC547s?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 1231000, "to": 1232000}, "text": " Yep."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1232000, "to": 1233000}, "text": " There you go."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1233000, "to": 1234000}, "text": " You know the numbers?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 1234000, "to": 1235000}, "text": " I do know the numbers."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1235000, "to": 1241000}, "text": " Yes, I do."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1241000, "to": 1244000}, "text": " 617T."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1244000, "to": 1247000}, "text": " Oh, I don't know that one."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1247000, "to": 1248000}, "text": " Maybe I'm not old enough."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1248000, "to": 1253000}, "text": " I might have it wrong."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1253000, "to": 1255000}, "text": " Oh, those are ceramic filters."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1255000, "to": 1256000}, "text": " Ah."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1256000, "to": 1257000}, "text": " You won't see those in use now,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 1257000, "to": 1260000}, "text": " because they use those for sidebands"}, {"offsets": {"from": 1260000, "to": 1264000}, "text": " and the old sideband radios."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1264000, "to": 1265000}, "text": " Yep."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1265000, "to": 1266000}, "text": " Ah, FETs."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1266000, "to": 1269000}, "text": " You've got some FETs in there as well."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1269000, "to": 1270000}, "text": " I've got a 548."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1270000, "to": 1271000}, "text": " That's right."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1271000, "to": 1272000}, "text": " Yep."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1272000, "to": 1274000}, "text": " 548, 547, 549."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1274000, "to": 1276000}, "text": " They're all the same."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1276000, "to": 1280000}, "text": " There's three of them."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1280000, "to": 1285000}, "text": " And I've got a couple of FETs."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1285000, "to": 1286000}, "text": " 3463."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1286000, "to": 1290000}, "text": " I think that's a very high-frequency one."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1290000, "to": 1292000}, "text": " Yeah, I could use that in my bug"}, {"offsets": {"from": 1292000, "to": 1294000}, "text": " and go up on there,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 1294000, "to": 1296000}, "text": " but I get too close to the aircraft."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1296000, "to": 1297000}, "text": " Right."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1297000, "to": 1298000}, "text": " There you go."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1298000, "to": 1299000}, "text": " You've got some 555."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1299000, "to": 1302000}, "text": " Well, that's a .55 in the blinker."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1302000, "to": 1304000}, "text": " 386 is an amplifier."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1304000, "to": 1305000}, "text": " It is."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1305000, "to": 1306000}, "text": " Power amplifier."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1306000, "to": 1307000}, "text": " Audio."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1307000, "to": 1308000}, "text": " Yeah."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1308000, "to": 1312000}, "text": " I sort of haven't done much about it."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1312000, "to": 1314000}, "text": " A battery tester, yep."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1314000, "to": 1318000}, "text": " You just put the battery in there against the lamp."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1318000, "to": 1319000}, "text": " Way too simple."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1319000, "to": 1321000}, "text": " It's a bit of brass tin-plated."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1321000, "to": 1322000}, "text": " RCA transistor."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1322000, "to": 1323000}, "text": " Oh, RCA."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1323000, "to": 1326000}, "text": " That's old."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1326000, "to": 1329000}, "text": " Transistor, thyristor, and diode manual."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1329000, "to": 1330000}, "text": " Oh, transistors."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1330000, "to": 1333000}, "text": " They're P&P."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1333000, "to": 1334000}, "text": " I don't use P&P."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1335000, "to": 1337000}, "text": " No, you're an NPN."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1337000, "to": 1339000}, "text": " You're the same, are you?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 1339000, "to": 1340000}, "text": " NPN."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1340000, "to": 1341000}, "text": " Yep, NPN."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1341000, "to": 1342000}, "text": " Yep."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1342000, "to": 1343000}, "text": " All the way."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1343000, "to": 1344000}, "text": " None of this P&P rubbish."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1344000, "to": 1347000}, "text": " And what's the date on that?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 1347000, "to": 1349000}, "text": " That would be historical, wouldn't it?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 1349000, "to": 1350000}, "text": " It would."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1350000, "to": 1351000}, "text": " Oh, 1971."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1351000, "to": 1352000}, "text": " That's not too old."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1352000, "to": 1353000}, "text": " 1975."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1353000, "to": 1355000}, "text": " No, it's 71."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1355000, "to": 1356000}, "text": " 1971, yeah."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1356000, "to": 1357000}, "text": " Yep."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1357000, "to": 1359000}, "text": " Well, I'd just write in to them"}, {"offsets": {"from": 1359000, "to": 1361000}, "text": " and they'd send them to you for nothing."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1361000, "to": 1362000}, "text": " Yeah."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1362000, "to": 1364000}, "text": " Just to sell their bits."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1364000, "to": 1366000}, "text": " Is this John Howard?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 1366000, "to": 1367000}, "text": " Yeah."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1367000, "to": 1368000}, "text": " John Howard."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1368000, "to": 1372000}, "text": " Oh, yeah, I painted some watercolour."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1372000, "to": 1374000}, "text": " Howard a bloke I didn't like."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1374000, "to": 1377000}, "text": " No, you didn't like John Howard?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 1377000, "to": 1379000}, "text": " Nobody liked him, I don't think."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1379000, "to": 1381000}, "text": " Nobody liked John Howard."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1381000, "to": 1382000}, "text": " He's nothing now, is he?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 1382000, "to": 1383000}, "text": " Exactly."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1383000, "to": 1385000}, "text": " Odds and ends draw."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1385000, "to": 1387000}, "text": " Lots of rules."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1387000, "to": 1390000}, "text": " It's right up the right top end corner"}, {"offsets": {"from": 1390000, "to": 1393000}, "text": " that you'll find a few resistors there."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1393000, "to": 1394000}, "text": " Yep."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1394000, "to": 1397000}, "text": " Mostly those are just standard sizes,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 1397000, "to": 1399000}, "text": " not just odd sizes."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1399000, "to": 1401000}, "text": " They're plug packs."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1401000, "to": 1404000}, "text": " Plug-in powers, all different ones."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1404000, "to": 1406000}, "text": " There's never the one you want."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1406000, "to": 1408000}, "text": " Never is, no."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1408000, "to": 1411000}, "text": " This one here is giving me about 16."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1411000, "to": 1413000}, "text": " I've started to clean it up."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1413000, "to": 1415000}, "text": " That's why you see these things in the box."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1415000, "to": 1417000}, "text": " There's another box there."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1417000, "to": 1423000}, "text": " I make my own charcoal for drawing with."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1423000, "to": 1425000}, "text": " Make your own charcoal."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1425000, "to": 1426000}, "text": " It's good charcoal."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1426000, "to": 1429000}, "text": " You add on, you lose 0.7 of a volt."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1429000, "to": 1432000}, "text": " So there's two points."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1432000, "to": 1434000}, "text": " You only get 1.2."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1434000, "to": 1435000}, "text": " Yep."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1435000, "to": 1437000}, "text": " Just enough to charge the AA."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1437000, "to": 1439000}, "text": " That's good enough, yeah."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1439000, "to": 1440000}, "text": " It works."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1440000, "to": 1441000}, "text": " Yeah?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 1441000, "to": 1442000}, "text": " I've had it on the bug."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1442000, "to": 1446000}, "text": " I see you had your FM bug working from solar-powered FM bug."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1446000, "to": 1447000}, "text": " Nice."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1457000, "to": 1458000}, "text": " Nice little bender."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1458000, "to": 1460000}, "text": " You put the sheet metal in there"}, {"offsets": {"from": 1460000, "to": 1462000}, "text": " and clamp these two clamps,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 1462000, "to": 1466000}, "text": " and it comes out here according to what you want,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 1466000, "to": 1469000}, "text": " and then you pull it up like that."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1469000, "to": 1470000}, "text": " Nice, nice."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1470000, "to": 1471000}, "text": " I like it."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1471000, "to": 1472000}, "text": " I made these."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1472000, "to": 1478000}, "text": " There's access there and there."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1478000, "to": 1479000}, "text": " Hi."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1479000, "to": 1483000}, "text": " I'm here with Colin Mitchell from Talking Electronics fame."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1483000, "to": 1486000}, "text": " Everyone in Australia will instantly recognize the name Colin Mitchell"}, {"offsets": {"from": 1486000, "to": 1489000}, "text": " in this Talking Electronics magazine,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 1489000, "to": 1490000}, "text": " and if you want to know,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 1490000, "to": 1493000}, "text": " I get asked all the time where I learned electronics"}, {"offsets": {"from": 1493000, "to": 1494000}, "text": " and how I learned electronics."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1494000, "to": 1496000}, "text": " Well, this man had a big hand in it,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 1496000, "to": 1498000}, "text": " so thank you very much, Colin."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1498000, "to": 1499000}, "text": " Good."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1499000, "to": 1500000}, "text": " That's lovely to see you."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1500000, "to": 1504000}, "text": " I learned a lot of electronics from the Talking Electronics magazine,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 1504000, "to": 1505000}, "text": " and we're here."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1505000, "to": 1507000}, "text": " Colin's going to take us through some old stuff,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 1507000, "to": 1510000}, "text": " and we're going to talk about the history of Talking Electronics."}], "source": "whisper-1-api"}